<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 7.09 points off FTSE, Feb 24.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 7.09 points off FTSE, Feb 24.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE 100 stocks will go ex-dividend on February 24 and analysts estimate the effect will be to take 7.09 points off the index that day.</p>
<p>					    DIVIDEND     INDEX</p>
<p>					    (PENCE)	EFFECT</p>
<p>  COMPANY				Net   Gross    Gross</p>
<p>* Barclays			   20.00  25.00    2.250</p>
<p>* Carlton Communications	  6.72   8.40    0.286</p>
<p>* Lloyds TSB Group		  9.00  11.25    3.510</p>
<p>* SmithKline Beecham		(a)    6.50    1.040</p>
</text>
